{"id":"capaz","lemma":"capaz","pos":"adv","rank":614,"glosses":["maybe, perhaps"],"ipa":"/kaˈpaθ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/95/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-capaz.wav","examples":[{"text":"Soy capaz de conducir un coche.","en":"I am able to drive a car.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/67578","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to drive"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"car, automobile"}]},{"text":"Pienso que él es capaz.","en":"I think he's competent.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/459826","words":[{"g":"animal feed"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"he"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null]},{"text":"No seré capaz de arreglar eso.","en":"I won't be able to fix that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/419342","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to fix"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"}]},{"text":"No soy capaz de hacerlo solo.","en":"I'm unable to do that on my own.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/427909","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"sole"}]},{"text":"Pensé que podría ser capaz de ayudar.","en":"I thought I might be able to help.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582604","words":[{"g":"to think, ponder","l":"pensar"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to be"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to help"}]}]}